l_entity\\\": \\\"cascade range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Coulter Glacier ( ) is a steeply inclined glacier , long , flowing south from the Havre Mountains , northern Alexander Island , into Lazarev Bay .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"coulter glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"havre mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Lukens is in an area that was impacted by the 2009 Station Fire in the San Gabriel Mountains , the largest wildfire in the history of Los Angeles County .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount lukens\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"san gabriel mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mola de Colldejou is a mountain chain in Catalonia , Spain located north of the Serra de Llaberia in the Catalan Pre - Coastal Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mola de colldejou\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"catalan pre-coastal range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Southern bank of the Main stretches up to the mountain range of the Franconian Jura ( Fränkische Alb ) beneath the Staffelberg close to Bad Staffelstein .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"staffelberg\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"franconian jura\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Woodberry Nunataks ( ) is a group of small nunataks 1   nautical mile ( 1.9   km ) north of Lucas Nunatak in the Casey Range , Framnes Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"lucas nunatak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"framnes mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Many mountains in the Pacific Ranges , including Mount Sir Francis Drake and Mount Queen Bess , and the Golden Hinde on Vancouver Island , were named in the 1930s as proposed by him .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount sir francis drake\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pacific ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"On the north during this stretch is the mile - high Caliente Range , which contains Caliente Mountain , the highest peak in San Luis Obispo County .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"caliente mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"caliente range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Neretva springs are situated deep in the Dinaric Alps at the base of the Zelengora and Lebršnik mountains under the village Jabuka and the saddle Gredelj .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"zelengora\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"dinaric alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Ferrara is a mountain in Antarctica , high , standing northeast of Vaca Nunatak in the Panzarini Hills portion of the Argentina Range , in the Pensacola Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"vaca nunatak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"argentina range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Canopy Cliffs ( ) are steep cliffs extending from Mount Allsup to Mount Ropar on the southeast side of Peletier Plateau , Queen Elizabeth Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount allsup\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen elizabeth range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Conant Valley is a valley between Duncan Bluff and Communication Heights in the southern part of the Darwin Mountains ; the valley mouth opens to Hatherton Glacier .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"communication heights\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"darwin mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"One of the White Mountains ' major passes , Kinsman Notch lies between Mount Moosilauke and Kinsman Ridge at just under above sea level .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kinsman notch\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"white mountains'\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Donald Ridge ( ) is a narrow ridge extending south from Mount Capley in the Pioneer Heights , Heritage Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pioneer heights\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"heritage range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"There are 10 Munro mountains ( mountains over 3,000   ft ) in the Mamores above Kinlochleven with Binnein Mor the highest .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"binnein mor\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mamores\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"To the east of the peak lies the large icefield which forms the head of the Brady Glacier , the southernmost of the large glaciers of the Saint Elias Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"brady glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"saint elias mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Howell ( ) is a mountain south - southwest of Mount Borgeson in the Walker Mountains of Thurston Island , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount borgeson\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"walker mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Kerckhove de Denterghem ( ) is a mountain , high , just north of Mount Collard in the Belgica Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount collard\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"belgica mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Titlis is the highest mountain in the portion of the Uri Alps north of the Susten Pass .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"titlis\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"uri alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Browns Butte ( ) is a bare rock butte at the north side of the mouth of Koski Glacier in the Dominion Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"browns butte\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"dominion range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Schaefer ( ) is a mountain ( 1,825   m ) which marks the west extremity of Robinson Heights in the Admiralty Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"robinson heights\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"admiralty mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"From Mount Norwottuck , the ridgeline of the Holyoke Range continues east as Long Mountain and west as Bare Mountain .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"bare mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"holyoke range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is part of the Bregenz district and due to the geographic location in the Allgäu Alps with its alpine terrain , the Kleinwalsertal has no direct traffic connection to the rest of Vorarlberg .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kleinwalsertal\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"allgäu alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Alligator Ridge ( ) is a spectacular serrated rock ridge in Antarctica , extending northeast for from Alligator Peak in the Boomerang Range into Skelton Neve .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"alligator peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"boomerang range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Kal'vets Rock ( ) is a rock outcrop lying west - southwest of the summit of Mount Flånuten on the west side of the Humboldt Mountains , Queen Maud Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount flånuten\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"humboldt mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Grant Ranch Park is situated in the Diablo Range , near Mount Hamilton .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount hamilton\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"diablo range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"In the Appalachian Mountains of the Eastern United States , Poor Mountain serves most of the FM and TV stations in the Roanoke / Lynchburg market .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"poor mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"appalachian mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"' Mautino Peak ' is a peak at the west side of Packard Glacier in the Saint Johns Range of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"packard glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"saint johns range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Hernandez Reservoir is an artificial lake created in by impounding water from the San Benito River in the Diablo Mountain Range of San Benito County , California .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hernandez reservoir\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"diablo mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Kondelwald , also known as the Kondel , is a forest , about 2,500 hectares in area and up to , that forms part of the Moselle Eifel .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kondel\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"moselle eifel\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Collinson Ridge ( ) is a bare rock spur next north of Halfmoon Bluff in the northwest part of the Cumulus Hills , Queen Maud Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"cumulus hills\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen maud mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Although only the thirteenth highest summit in the Allgäu Alps , the Hochvogel dominates other parts of Allgäu Alps and the other ranges in the immediate neighbourhood .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hochvogel\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"allgäu alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Fitzsimmons ( ) is a peak standing between Mount Jackling and Mount Shideler in the northern group of the Rockefeller Mountains on Edward VII Peninsula , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount shideler\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"rockefeller mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Kyshtym ( ) is a town in Chelyabinsk Oblast , Russia , located on the eastern slopes of the Southern Ural Mountains northwest of Chelyabinsk , near the town of Ozyorsk .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"chelyabinsk oblast\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"ural mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Plummer Glacier ( ) is a short glacier descending east through the Enterprise Hills to the north of Lippert Peak and the Douglas Peaks , in the Heritage Range in Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"enterprise hills\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"heritage range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Sørlle Buttress ( ) is a mountain rising above , between Mount Spaaman and Three Brothers in the Allardyce Range of South Georgia .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"three brothers\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"allardyce range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The peak is located a few kilometres northeast of Tirich Mir ( the highest mountain in the Hindu Kush ) , across the Tirich Glacier .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"tirich mir\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"hindu kush\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Elder Glacier ( ) is a tributary glacier entering the Tucker Glacier just west of Oread Spur , in the Victory Mountains of Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"elder glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"victory mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"As the weather cleared , Tuckett now realized that even the tediously conquered Großer Möseler was not the highest mountain in the Zillertal Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"großer möseler\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"zillertal alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Shispare ( ) is one of the high peaks of the Batura Muztagh , \\\\n which is the westernmost subrange of the Karakoram range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"batura muztagh\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"karakoram\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Astor Rocks ( ) are two small rock outcrops lying southeast of Mount Ramenskiy in the southeast extremity of the Wohlthat Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount ramenskiy\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"wohlthat mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Gjel Glacier ( ) is a glacier , long , flowing north betwee