lation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Helm Glacier ( ) is a glacier , long , flowing north to enter Lowery Glacier just west of the Fazekas Hills , in the Queen Elizabeth Range of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"fazekas hills\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen elizabeth range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The highest mountains in the Commonwealth are located in the Allegheny Mountains in western Pennsylvania , where Mount Davis stands at .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount davis\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"allegheny mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Barbeau Peak , the highest mountain in Nunavut ( ) is located in the British Empire Range on Ellesmere Island .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"barbeau peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"british empire range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"9 eventually draws close to the Northway again at Poke - O - Moonshine Mountain , the Adirondacks ' most popular climbing spot .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"poke-o-moonshine mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"adirondacks\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Ristkalvane Nunataks ( coordinates : 71 ° 41′S 10 ° 36′E ) is a small group of nunataks forming the north end of Shcherbakov Range , in the Orvin Mountains of Queen Maud Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ristkalvane nunataks\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"shcherbakov range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Midway Glacier ( ) is a tributary glacier that flows south along the west side of Evans Ridge into Pearl Harbor Glacier , in the Victory Mountains of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pearl 