ded in the Welsh 3000s .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"foel grach\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"snowdonia\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The beck rises in the Whinlatter Forest in the Lake District at the confluence of Grisedale Gill and Sanderson Gill , streams draining the mountain of Grisedale Pike .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"whinlatter forest\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lake district\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Brown Conservation Park is a protected area in the Flinders Ranges of South Australia .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount brown\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"flinders ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Gorton ( ) is a prominent mountain , high , located west - southwest of Mount Perez in the southern Wilson Hills of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount perez\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"wilson hills\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Pumlumon Fach is a top of Pen Pumlumon Fawr on the Plynlimon massif , a part of the Cambrian Mountains in the county of Ceredigion , Wales .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pumlumon fach\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"cambrian mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Puente Hills is a chain of hills , one of the lower Transverse Ranges , in an unincorporated area in eastern Los Angeles County , California , USA .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"puente hills\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"transverse ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The first Burgess Shale fossils were found on Mount Stephen in Canada 's Rocky Mountains by a construction worker , whose reports of them reached Richard McConnell of the Geological Survey of Canada .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount stephen\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"rocky mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The park has views of Dublin Bay , Killiney Bay , Bray Head and the mountain of Great Sugar Loaf ( 506 m ) , stretching from the Wicklow Mountains right across to Howth Head .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"bray head\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"wicklow mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It has an area of 50   km2 and is a subrange of the Boundary Ranges which in turn form part of the Coast Mountains . Adam Mountains in the Canadian Mountain Encyclopedia\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"adam mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"boundary ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Within Nevada , his route generally followed the lake to Glenbrook , where it turned inland and crossed the Carson Range over Spooner Summit into the Carson Valley near Carson City .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"spooner summit\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"carson range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The only group in the Northern Limestone Alps with a three - thousander is the Lechtal Alps , whose highest summit is the Parseierspitze at .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"parseierspitze\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lechtal alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Aspen Mountain forms the end of Richmond Ridge , a long ridge that extends 10 miles south at approximately to join the main spine of the Elk Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"aspen mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"elk mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"To the east , in the Soria mountains , you can see the Sistema Ibérico , presided over by the Moncayo Massif , its highest peak .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"moncayo massif\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sistema ibérico\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Jalovec in the Julian Alps down to the Gulf of Trieste near Monfalcone .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"jalovec\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"julian alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"North - northeast of the Zirler Berg a particularly winding section of the Karwendel Railway with many tunnels runs over the Seefeld Saddle roughly parallel to the \\\\\\\" Seefelder Straße \\\\\\\" .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"zirler berg\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"karwendel\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Manning Massif ( ) is a large rock massif between Loewe Massif and McLeod Massif in the eastern part of the Aramis Range , Prince Charles Mountains , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mcleod massif\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"prince charles mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Saxton Ridge ( ) is a mountain ridge just south of Thomson Massif in the Aramis Range , Prince Charles Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"thomson massif\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"prince charles mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Aryanadu is an Indian village town lying under the foothills of the Agastyarkoodam of the Sahya mountains , in the state of Kerala .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"agastyarkoodam\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sahya mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Rote Wand ( \\\\\\\" Red Wall \\\\\\\" ) is a mountain in the Lechquellen Mountains range of Vorarlberg , in western Austria .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"red wall\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lechquellen mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"In January 1999 Andrew and his friend Jamie Fisher got caught in a storm after having climbed the north face of Les Droites in the Mont Blanc massif .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"les droites\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mont blanc massif\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Ilmensky Mountains ( ) are located in the Southern Urals in the Chelyabinsk Oblast on the administrative territory of Miass in Chebarkulsky and Argayashsky districts .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ilmensky mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"southern urals\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Noxon ( ) is a peak of the Walker Mountains , rising at the head of Myers Glacier on Thurston Island .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"myers glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"walker mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Bernau is located in a high valley in the southern Black Forest , south of the Feldberg and west of the Schluchsee .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"feldberg\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"black forest\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The municipality lies in the west of Hermagor at the transition of the upper Gail Valley into the Lesachtal , between the Gailtal and Carnic Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"lesachtal\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"gailtal\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Kirk Glacier ( ) is a tributary glacier draining southeast along the south side of Fischer Ridge into Ironside Glacier , in the Admiralty Mountains of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ironside glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"admiralty mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mountains nearby Cumiana include the Monte Tre Denti and Monte Freidour , parts of the Cottian Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"monte freidour\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"cottian alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Hallstätter Glacier ( ) ( formerly also called the \\\\\\\" Karleisfeld \\\\\\\" or Karl Icefield ) is the largest glacier in the Dachstein Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hallstätter glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"dachstein mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"In 1892 , with a troop of Gurkha soldiers he accompanied Conway in his exploration of the Baltoro region of the Karakorum , visiting Muztagh Tower , Broad Peak and K2 .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"muztagh tower\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"baltoro\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The highest peak of Chornohora is Hoverla ( 2,062 m ) with other high peaks including Pip Ivan ( 2,022 m ) and Petros ( 2,020 m ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pip ivan\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"chornohora\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Purvis Peak ( ) is a peak ( 2,250   m ) 2   nautical miles ( 3.7   km ) northeast of Mount Northampton in the Victory Mountains of Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount northampton\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"victory mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Parry Peak is also the highest peak of the James Group of the Front Range of Colorado .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"parry peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"front range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is one of the northernmost mountain ranges in the world which in turn form part of the Arctic Cordillera mountain system . Grogan Morgan Range , Canada\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"grogan morgan range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"arctic cordillera\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Marriner ( ) is a mountain west - southwest of Mount Flett in the central Nye Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount flett\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"nye mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Cima di Pian Guarnei ( also known as \\\\\\\" Pizzo Quadro \\\\\\\" ) is a mountain of the Lepontine Alps on the Swiss - Italian border .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pizzo quadro\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lepontine alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"In the north , the road leads up to the Loibl Pass in the Karawanks mountain range , the border with the Austrian state of Carinthia .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"loibl pass\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"karawanks\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Cara ( ) is a peak , high , standing north - northwest of Mount Lysaght in the Queen Elizabeth Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount lysaght\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen elizabeth range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Sulphur and Topatopa Mountains are part of the Transverse Ranges system .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"topatopa mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"transverse ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Heidemann Glacier is a glacier , long , originating close northwest of Mount Damm in the Queen Elizabeth Range of Antarctica and flowing east into Lowery Glacier .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount damm\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen elizabeth range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Biberkopf lies on the main crest of the Allgäu Alps on the border between the Bavarian district of Oberallgäu and the Tyrolean district of Reutte .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"biberkopf\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"allgäu alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is in elevation and stands in the Waddington Range six kilometres southeast of Mount Waddington , which is the highest summit in the Coast Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount waddington\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"waddington range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The highest peak of the Entiat Mountains is Mount Fernow , at .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount fernow\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"entiat mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Grimsley ( ) is a small mountain southwest of Mount Abbs in the Aramis Range of the Prince Charles Mountains , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount abbs\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"prince charles mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Stanley Baldwin is a mountain located in the Premier Range of the Cariboo Mountains in the east - central interior of British Columbia , Canada .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"premier range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"cariboo mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"At the Nußhardt is the third highest mountain in the Fichtel Mountains in the south German state of Bavaria .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"nußhardt\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"fichtel mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Sledging Col ( ) is a col between Mount Griffith and a very low peak on its northeast side , in the Hays Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount griffith\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"hays mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Ahornbüchsenkopf rises in the Berchtesgaden Alps around 2.8   km north - northeast of the Hoher Göll and just under 6   km ( both as the crow flies ) east of Berchtesgaden .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ahornbüchsenkopf\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"berchtesgaden alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Located north of Yarlung Tsangpo river on the southern edge of the Tibetan Plateau , the Transhimalaya is composed of the Gangdise range to the west and the Nyenchen Tanglha range to the east .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"nyenchen tanglha\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"transhimalaya\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Großes Teufelshorn ( ) is the higher and more northerly summit of the two Teufelshörner and the highest peak in the Hagen Mountains , a part of the Berchtesgaden Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hagen mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"berchtesgaden alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The closest crossings of the Sierra Nevada are SR 120 via Tioga Pass to the north and Sherman Pass to the south .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sherman pass\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sierra nevada\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Tecuya Mountain in southern Kern County , California , more than high , is the highest point on the Tecuya Ridge of the San Emigdio Mountains in the Transverse Ranges .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"san emigdio mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"transverse ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"At 2,519 metres above sea level , it is the highest peak of the Parâng Mountains , located in the Parâng Mountains group of the Southern Carpathians .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"parâng mountains group\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"southern carpathians\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Cooke Peak ( ) is a somewhat elongated mountain surmounted by a central peak , standing northwest of the Bode Nunataks in the Grove Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"bode nunataks\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"grove mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Veslenupen Peak ( ) is a peak near the north end of Nupskammen Ridge in the Gjelsvik Mountains , Queen Maud Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"nupskammen ridge\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"gjelsvik mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Kröndlhorn is a high mountain in the Kitzbühel Alps in Austria .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kröndlhorn\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"kitzbühel alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"On clear days , the peak should be seen from Mount Diablo , and from several peaks , including Mount Saint Helena and Mount Konocti , in the Mayacamas Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount saint helena\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mayacamas mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"After the Selbhorn ( ) and Schönfeldspitze ( ) the Brandhorn is the third highest peak in the Steinernes Meer .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"schönfeldspitze\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"steinernes meer\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Like most other mountain ranges in the Canadian Arctic , the Inglefield Mountains are part of the Arctic Cordillera .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"inglefield mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"arctic cordillera\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Boundary Cone landmark , lies east , at the northwest perimeter of the Black Mesa ( western Arizona ) , a subsection mountain region at the southern end of the Black Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"boundary cone\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"black mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Also known as the Blue Cow Mountain , Mount Blue Cow or The Blue Cow , the mountain lies within the Main Range of Snowy Mountains , part of the Great Dividing Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"blue cow mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"snowy mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The part of the road that crosses the Balkan Mountains through the Varbitsa Pass is in a very bad condition and in winter it closes for traffic .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"varbitsa pass\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"balkan mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Saumspitze is a mountain in the Verwall Alps , a mountain range of the Central Eastern Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"verwall alps\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"central eastern alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Bennett Nunataks ( ) are two rock nunataks apart , lying 0.5 nautical miles north of Lackey Ridge in the Ohio Range of the Horlick Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"lackey ridge\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"horlick mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"From this place is a view of the Parângu Mare peak and when the weather is good you can see the Peleaga peak of Retezat Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"peleaga\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"retezat mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Carnegie Range ( ) is a mountain range of the Transantarctic Mountains System , in the Ross Dependency .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"carnegie range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"transantarctic mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Altarduken Glacier is a small glacier just east of The Altar at the head of Grautskala Cirque , in the Humboldt Mountains of Queen Maud Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"the altar\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"humboldt mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Heimdall Glacier ( ) is a small glacier just east of Siegfried Peak and Siegmund Peak on the south side of Wright Valley in the Asgard Range of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"siegmund peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"asgard range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It lies within a caldera atop the volcanic Paektu Mountain , a part of the Baekdudaegan mountain range and the Changbai mountain range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"paektu mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"changbai\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Hoffman Glacier ( ) is a narrow glacier , long , flowing eastward from Mount Miller in the Holland Range of Antarctica to enter Lennox - King Glacier south of Rhodes Peak .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hoffman glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"holland range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Big Pine Mountain is a mountain located in the San Rafael Mountains of the California Transverse Ranges .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"san rafael mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"transverse ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Rosenthal ( ) is a prominent mountain , 1,840 m , at the north end of Liberty Hills , in the Heritage Range , Ellsworth Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"heritage range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"ellsworth mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Butler Range is a subrange of the Finlay Ranges of the Omineca Mountains , located on the west side of Finlay Reach in northern British Columbia , Canada .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"butler range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"finlay ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"He has also made first descents of other mountains in the Teton Range , including Middle Teton , South Teton , Mount Moran , and Mount Owen .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"middle teton\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"teton range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Hocheisspitze is a 2,523   m high mountain in the Berchtesgaden Alps , over which the border between Germany and Austria runs .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hocheisspitze\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"berchtesgaden alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The sub - group of the Main Chain of the Allgäu Alps ( \\\\\\\" Zentraler Hauptkamm \\\\\\\" ) extends from the Schrofen Pass to the Mädelejoch saddle and forms the centre of the Allgäu Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"schrofen pass\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"allgäu alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Sorensen Peak ( ) is a peak ( 2,640   m ) which rises between the base of Lyttelton Range and Church Ridge in the Admiralty Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"church ridge\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"admiralty mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"In the summer of 1840 , Bryant explored the Kaaterskill area of the Catskills with Cole .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kaaterskill\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"catskills\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It was named after the Reißeck massif ( 2,965m/9,727   ft ) in the north , part of the Ankogel Group of the Hohe Tauern mountain range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"reißeck massif\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"ankogel group\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The heavily - wooded Vorholz is located in the north of the Innerste Uplands , part of the Lower Saxon Hills .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"vorholz\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"innerste uplands\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Handsley Valley is a small ice - free valley between Knobhead and Mount Handsley in the Quartermain Mountains of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount handsley\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"quartermain mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It lies on the main chain of the Bernese Alps , between the Rawil Pass and the Plaine Morte Glacier .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"rawil pass\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"bernese alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is located in the Southern Alps on the south ridge of Mount Tasman ( 3,497 m ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount tasman\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"southern alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Rock climbing is a popular activity in the Peak District ; particularly on edges such as Stanage or Froggatt .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"stanage\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"peak district\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Grazzini Bay is an ice - filled coastal embayment , , between Gentile Point and Fisher Point on the east side of the Darley Hills , in the Churchill Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"darley hills\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"churchill mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Skaret Pass is a mountain pass at the east side of Skarsnuten Peak in the Roots Heights , Sverdrup Mountains , in Queen Maud Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"skarsnuten peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sverdrup mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Bulkisen ( ) is a blue ice field between Austhamaren Peak and Bulken Hill in the Sør Rondane Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"austhamaren peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sør rondane mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Pointe de Boveire is a mountain of the Pennine Alps , located between Fionnay and Liddes in the canton of Valais .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pointe de boveire\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pennine alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Parima Mountains are located in the western part of the Guiana Shield , there they run for approximately 320 km in a north – south direction in the border area of Brazil and Venezuela .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"parima mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"guiana shield\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"This town is located close to the limits of Guadalajara Province in the Mesa River valley , at the feet of the Sierra de Solorio range , Sistema Ibérico .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sierra de solorio\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sistema ibérico\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"On 24 January 1832 , he made the first recorded ascent of a peak in the Stirling Range , scaling Toolbrunup .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"toolbrunup\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"stirling range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Transcaucasian Highway \\\\n\\\\n\\\\n It crosses the Greater Caucasus mountain range through the Roki Tunnel , connecting North Ossetia – Alania and Russia with South Ossetia and Georgia .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"roki tunnel\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"greater caucasus\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The southern prolongation of the Chin Hills is the Arakan Range ( Arakan Yoma ) , stretching as well from north to south .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"chin hills\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"arakan range (arakan yoma)\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The next highest mountain in the area is the Acherkogel ( ) in the Stubai Alps , which gives the Zugspitze a topographic isolation value of 24.6   kilometres .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"acherkogel\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"stubai alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Gilmore Lake in California is a backcountry lake in the Sierra Nevada mountain range , to the west of Lake Tahoe in the Desolation Wilderness .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"gilmore lake\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sierra nevada\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Cima Garlenda is a 2141   m mountain of the Ligurian Alps , in Italy .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"cima garlenda\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"ligurian alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The neighboring highlands are called the Issaquah Alps and feature hiking trails and outdoor activity throughout the three mountains surrounding Issaquah : Tiger Mountain , Cougar Mountain , and Squak Mountain .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"tiger mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"issaquah alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Lee Peak ( ) is a peak along the west side of Scott Glacier , north of Mount Denauro , in the Queen Maud Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount denauro\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen maud mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Darrow School is located on Mount Lebanon in the Taconic Mountains , just to the west of the central Berkshires , in New Lebanon , New York .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount lebanon\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"taconic mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Gambacorta Peak is a peak , high , standing east of Mount Kaschak in the southern Neptune Range , Pensacola Mountains , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount kaschak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"neptune range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The byway encircles Wheeler Peak ( ) of the Sangre de Cristo Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"wheeler peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sangre de cristo mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The town is located at high elevation between the Sierra del Pobo and Sierra de Gúdar , part of the Sistema Ibérico .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sierra de gúdar\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sistema ibérico\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Becs de Bosson are a multi - summited mountain of the Pennine Alps , located between St - Martin and Grimentz , in the canton of Valais .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"becs de bosson\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pennine alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The shrine is located near the summit of Mount Akiha , on the southern slopes of the Akaishi Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount akiha\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"akaishi mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mitterhorn ( elevation ) is a summit in the Steinernes Meer of the Berchtesgaden Alps in the Austrian state of Salzburg .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"steinernes meer\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"berchtesgaden alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Inside Lower Saxony it is the second largest range of hills and the third highest after the Harz ( Wurmberg ; ) and the Kaufungen Forest ( Haferberg ; ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"haferberg\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"kaufungen forest\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Coniston Old Man , the highest summit in the group , is the farthest south 2000-foot summit in the Lake District ( using a 30-metre relative height criterion to determine what a summit is ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"coniston old man\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lake district\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"SR 108 runs generally northeast across central California from downtown Modesto near the SR 99/SR 132 interchange , crossing the Sierra Nevada at Sonora Pass , to U.S. Route 395 near the Nevada state line .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sonora pass\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sierra nevada\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is part of wider Kučaj mountain system , which belongs to Serbian Carpathians range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kučaj\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"serbian carpathians\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Sulcis Range is to the west and includes Monti Arcosu , , and Punta Sebera .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"monti arcosu\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sulcis range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Its interior is entirely occupied by Imeon Range rising to ( Mount Foster ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount foster\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"imeon range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Maja Jezercë is situated within the Albanian Alps , that is noted for its southernmost glaciers in Europe .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"maja jezercë\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"albanian alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It continues east through the mountainous Agrafa area , part of the Pindus mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"agrafa\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pindus\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It reaches a height of 483   m ( 1,585   ft ) and it is ( along with Binsey ) the most northerly fell in the Lake District .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"binsey\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lake district\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Ball peak is a mountain tall at the head of Loftus Glacier in the Asgard Range , Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"loftus glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"asgard range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is one of the northernmost mountain ranges in the world forming part of the Arctic Cordillera mountain system . Grinnell Range , Canada\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"grinnell range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"arctic cordillera\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The source of the Tordino is located between Monte Gorzano and Pelone , in the Monti della Laga subchain of the Apennines .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"monte gorzano\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"monti della laga\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The eastern part of the province features the Dolomites , including the famous Tofane , Marmolada , Tre Cime di Lavaredo and Antelao .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"tofane\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"dolomites\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"A second Mount Lindesay ( New South Wales ) was later named by Sir Thomas Mitchell , attaching to a dominant mountain in the Nandewar Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount lindesay (new south wales)\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"nandewar range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Together with the Trettachspitze and Mädelegabel , the Hochfrottspitze forms the famous triumvirate of peaks on the main crest of the Allgäu Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mädelegabel\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"allgäu alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Cordillera Central includes Luzon 's highest peak Mount Pulag along with other high peaks such as Mount Puguis , Mount Polis and Mount Data .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount pulag\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"cordillera central\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"He has also made first descents of other mountains in the Teton Range , including Middle Teton , South Teton , Mount Moran , and Mount Owen .\\\", \\\"hea