ge\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The culminating point of the Anterior Rhine 's drainage basin is the Piz Russein of the Tödi massif of the Glarus Alps at above sea level .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"piz russein\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"glarus alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Gale ( ) is a promontory at the north end of Frecker Ridge in the Anare Mountains of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"frecker ridge\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"anare mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Edlin Névé ( ) is a névé at the south side of Mount Sturm in the Bowers Mountains of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"edlin névé\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"bowers mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Moncodeno ( \\\\\\\" Moncoeuden \\\\\\\" in Lombard ) is the northern mountain slope of the Grigna , part of the Bergamasque Alps   in the province of Lecco , Lombardy , northern Italy .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"grigna\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"bergamasque alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"LaBelle Valley ( ) is a valley , long , between Peterson Terrace and Price Terrace in the Cruzen Range of Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"peterson terrace\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"cruzen range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mendenhall Peak ( ) is a peak , high , standing west of Mount Wrather in the eastern part of the Thiel Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount wrather\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"thiel mountains\\\", 