lation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Shani (; Gora Shan in Russian ) is a mountain in the Caucasus .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"gora shan\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"caucasus\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Snowdon Massif is one of the three mountain groups in Snowdonia , north Wales , to include mountains over 3,000 feet ( 914   m ) high .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"snowdon massif\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"snowdonia\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Lunde ( ) is a mountain ridge close south of Mount Gleadell , in the western part of the Tula Mountains in Enderby Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount gleadell\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tula mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\" Packera franciscana \\\\\\\" grows on two of Arizona 's San Francisco Peaks , Humphreys Peak and Agassiz Peak , and the saddle between them .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"agassiz peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"san francisco peaks\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Ghent Kangri ( or Mount Ghent , Ghaint I ) is a high peak near the north end of the Saltoro Mountains , a subrange of the Karakoram range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ghent kangri\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"saltoro mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The strata from which remains of \\\\\\\" Menatalligator \\\\\\\" have been found are part of the Chaîne des Puys , a volcanically active chain of mountains in the Massif Central .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"chaîne des puys\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"massif central\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Glover Hills ( ) are prominent hills separating Atka Glacier and Baxter Glacier in the Convoy Range , Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"atka glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"convoy range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Swiss geologist Arnold Henry Guyot , after whom Mount Guyot is named , visited Montvale in 1859 during his survey of the Great Smoky Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount guyot\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"great smoky mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is identifiable as the tall peak between Mount Arethusa and Mist Mountain at the far south end of the Misty Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mist mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"misty range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Ili River drains the basin between the Tian Shan and the Borohoro Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"borohoro mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tian shan\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It has an area of 235   km2 and is a subrange of the Boundary Ranges which in turn form part of the Coast Mountains . Lincoln Mountains in the Canadian Mountain Encyclopedia\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"lincoln mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"boundary ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It lies in the Massif de la Vanoise range , between Les Menuires and the La Masse peak .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"les menuires\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"massif de la vanoise\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The glacier is in the Icelandic Highlands and is situated between Bárðarbunga , Holuhraun and Kverkfjöll .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"bárðarbunga\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"icelandic highlands\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Piccolo Summit is a summit in the Fitzsimmons Range of the Garibaldi Ranges of the Pacific Ranges in southwestern British Columbia , Canada .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"piccolo summit\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"fitzsimmons range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Fleming Summit ( ) is a peak rising to over , west of Mount Kirkpatrick in the Queen Alexandra Range , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount kirkpatrick\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen alexandra range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Borowski Peak ( ) is a small but distinctive peak , high , located southwest of Rand Peak in the Nebraska Peaks , Britannia Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"nebraska peaks\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"britannia range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Burdekin River rises on the western slopes of the Seaview Range , part of the Great Dividing Range , west of .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"seaview range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"great dividing range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Some of the most popular landmarks located in the Forest include the Flaming Gorge National Recreation Area and the Uinta Mountains , which contains the highest mountain peak in Utah ( Kings Peak ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kings peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"uinta mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"This Wind River Range alpine glacier is associated with the largest grouping of glaciers in the U.S. Rocky Mountains and lies on the north slope of Fremont Peak , the third tallest mountain in Wyoming .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"fremont peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"wind river range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The county 's highest point is Cache Peak at an elevation of above sea level in the Albion Mountains , and the lowest is Milner Lake , a reservoir on the Snake River , at .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"cache peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"albion mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Blauberge are part of Upper Bavaria 's Mangfall Mountains or more precisely the Tegernsee Mountains and are located about 11 kilometres south of the Tegernsee lake .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"blauberge\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mangfall mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mont Maudit ( 4,465 m ) is a mountain in the Mont Blanc massif in France and Italy .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mont maudit\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mont blanc massif\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It originates in Hatcher Pass , at , in the Talkeetna Mountains which form the northern boundary of the Matanuska - Susitna Valley .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hatcher pass\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"talkeetna mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Skarsbrotet Glacier ( ) is a cirque - type glacier draining the east slopes of Skarshaugane Peaks , in the Humboldt Mountains of Queen Maud Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"skarshaugane peaks\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"humboldt mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Dalrymple is a mountain in the Clarke Range , part of the Great Dividing Range , located in Central Queensland , Australia .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"clarke range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"great dividing range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Arcondo Nunatak ( ) is a nunatak , high , standing south of Mount Spann in the Panzarini Hills portion of the Argentina Range of the Pensacola Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"panzarini hills\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"argentina range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"the Raucheck is the highest peak in the Tennen Mountains in the Northern Limestone Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"raucheck\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tennen mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Bryse Peaks ( ) are the twin peaks of a small nunatak , located north - northeast of Mason Peaks in the Grove Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mason peaks\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"grove mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Devold Peak ( ) is a peak , high , between Kjelbotn Peak and the Pukkelen Rocks near the head of Byrdbreen in the Sør Rondane Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kjelbotn peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sør rondane mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Its source is in the Chatkal Range , western Tian Shan mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"chatkal range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tian shan\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Shinn is a mountain 4,661 meters in elevation , standing 6   km ( 4   miles ) southeast of Mount Tyree in the Sentinel Range , Ellsworth Mountains in Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount tyree\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sentinel range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The highest mountain in Sardinia , Punta La Marmora , in the Gennargentu mountain range is within the boundaries of the National Park .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"punta la marmora\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"gennargentu\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Commenced in 1968 and completed in 1971 , Talbingo Dam is a major dam on the Tumut River , within the Snowy Mountains , approximately south of the village of Talbingo .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"talbingo dam\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"snowy mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Berchtesgaden Hochthron is the highest peak of the Untersberg massif in the Berchtesgaden Alps in Berchtesgaden , Bavaria , Germany .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"untersberg\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"berchtesgaden alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Yendegaia River originates from the terminus of Stoppani Glacier in Cordillera Darwin located at southwestern Isla Grande de Tierra del Fuego .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"stoppani glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"cordillera darwin\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Pratts Peak is a rock peak in Antarctica located east of Mount Provender in the west part of Shackleton Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount provender\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"shackleton range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The mountain has an elevation of   and is a part of the Mahoosuc Range of the White Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mahoosuc range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"white mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The peak is situated in the central part of the Pieck Range in the Petermann Ranges of Queen Maud Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pieck range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"petermann ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Because of its geographic position in the heart of the Dolomites , Alta Badia gradually transformed itself into an avantgarde tourist area keeping intact its alpine character .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"alta badia\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"dolomites\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"To the north is the imposing Schiara range of the Dolomites , with the famous \\\\\\\" Gusela del Vescovà \\\\\\\" ( Bishopric 's needle ) , and Mounts Serva and Talvena rising above the city .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"schiara\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"dolomites\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Lensen Glacier ( ) is a tributary glacier that flows northeast to enter Pearl Harbor Glacier just east of Mount Pearson , in the Victory Mountains of Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"lensen glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"victory mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Rennfeld ( 1,629 m ) is a mountain in the Fischbach Alps , part of the Prealps east of the Mur .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"fischbach alps\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"prealps east of the mur\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Sgòr Gaoith is a mountain in the western massif of the Cairngorms , and is separated from the Braeriach massif by the broad valley of Glen Einich .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"braeriach\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"cairngorms\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Apsarasas Kangri is a mountain in the Siachen Karakoram range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"siachen\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"karakoram\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Moccasin Gap , also known as Big Moccasin Gap , is a pass in Clinch Mountain , a long ridge within the Appalachian Mountains , at Gate City , Virginia .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"clinch mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"appalachian mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Its source is in the Hășmaș Mountains of the eastern Carpathian Mountains , near Bălan , rising close to the headwaters of the Mureș River .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hășmaș mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"carpathian mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Nylen Glacier ( ) is a narrow glacier between Schlatter Glacier and Fountain Glacier in Asgard Range , McMurdo Dry Valleys ; it flows south into Pearse Valley .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"fountain glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"asgard range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Keyser ( ) is a mountain east of Mount Ryder , in the eastern part of the Tula Mountains in Enderby Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount ryder\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tula mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Bermel Escarpment ( ) is a snow and rock escarpment , long , extending from the base of the Ford Massif to King Peak , in the Thiel Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"king peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"thiel mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Jennings ( ) is a peak rising to about immediately south of Mount Roy in the Barker Range of the Victory Mountains , in Victoria Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"barker range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"victory mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The highest summit in the Lützelsoon is the Womrather Höhe at .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"womrather höhe\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lützelsoon\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Springtail Point is a rock point 3 nautical miles ( 6   km ) north of Skew Peak in the Clare Range , Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"skew peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"clare range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The mountain is part of the Pilot Range of the White Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pilot range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"white mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Cima Piazzi , Cima de ' Piazzi , del Piazzi or di Piazzi ( 3,439 m ) is the highest mountain of the Livigno Alps in Lombardy , Italy .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"cima piazzi\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"livigno alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Tazlina Lake lies at the base of Tazlina Glacier in the Chugach Mountains north of Valdez .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"tazlina glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"chugach mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Maines , also known as Stornuten , is a mountain , , standing roughly SE of Stor Hånakken Mountain and W of Mount Elkins in the Napier Mountains , Enderby Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"stor hånakken mountain\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"napier mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Nichols Ridge ( ) is a rock ridge between Denton Glacier and Decker Glacier in east Asgard Range , Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"decker glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"asgard range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Styx Glacier ( ) is a tributary glacier in the Southern Cross Mountains , flowing southeast to enter Campbell Glacier between Wood Ridge and Pinckard Table , in Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"wood ridge\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"southern cross mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"This town is located at the feet of the Sierra de Javalambre , Sistema Ibérico .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sierra de javalambre\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sistema ibérico\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Leitch Massif ( ) is a mountain massif that forms the northern part of the West Quartzite Range , in the Concord Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"west quartzite range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"concord mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Turton River rises below Trapyard Hill , drawing its source from the southeastern slopes of Mount Wellington and the southwestern slopes of the Moroka Range , both part of the Great Dividing Range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount wellington\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"great dividing range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Svarthornkammen Ridge ( ) is a high rock ridge extending north for 5   nautical miles ( 9   km ) from Svarthorna Peaks in the Mittlere Petermann Range , Wohlthat Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"svarthorna peaks\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mittlere petermann range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Dart is a mountain southeast of Mount Dwyer in the Athos Range of the Prince Charles Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount dwyer\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"prince charles mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is a subrange of the Torngat Mountains which in turn form part of the southern section of the Arctic Cordillera mountain system . Selamiut Range , Canada\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"torngat mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"arctic cordillera\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Eldon Hill is a hill in the Peak District National Park in the county of Derbyshire , England , southwest of the village of Castleton .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"eldon hill\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"peak district\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Odin Glacier ( ) is a small glacier that drains the west slopes of Mount Odin in the Asgard Range , Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"odin glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"asgard range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Zuckerhut ( ) is a peak ( 2,525 m ) standing southeast of Ritscher Peak in the Gruber Mountains of Queen Maud Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ritscher peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"gruber mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Schareck , a mountain with a height of , lies in the Goldberg Group of the High Tauern in Austria .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"goldberg group\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"high tauern\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The hut lies at a height of above sea level , above the Unteraar Glacier , at the foot of the Hienderstock in the Bernese Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"hienderstock\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"bernese alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Fitzgerald Nunataks ( ) are three isolated nunataks north of Mount Codrington , at the northwest end of the Napier Mountains in Enderby Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount codrington\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"napier mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Its easterly border at its most abrupt reaches more than at Semnoz , the final peak of the Bauges Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"semnoz\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"bauges mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Important peaks in the parish territory are the 2,762 m high Rastkogel and the 2,506 m high Gilfert , both in the Tux Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"gilfert\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tux alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Crestones are a cluster of high summits in the Sangre de Cristo Range , comprising Crestone Peak , Crestone Needle , Kit Carson Peak , Challenger Point , Humboldt Peak , and Columbia Point .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kit carson peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sangre de cristo range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Crosby Nunataks ( ) are a set of three nunataks northeast of Mount Morrison , in the northern part of the Tula Mountains in Enderby Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount morrison\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tula mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Pădurea Craiului Mountains are in the northwestern part of the Apuseni Mountains of the Carpathian Mountain range , located between the Vad - Borod Depression and Beiuş Depression .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"apuseni mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"carpathian mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Walker Ridge ( ) is a high mountain ridge between Stafford Glacier and Coral Sea Glacier in the Victory Mountains of Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"stafford glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"victory mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Its source on the north slope of Zwang Peak of the Diablo Range , in Kings County .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"zwang peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"diablo range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Thor is part of the Baffin Mountains which in turn form part of the Arctic Cordillera mountain range .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount thor\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"baffin mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Found in southern India in the Western Ghats : south of the Goa Gap , Anaimalai , Cardamom ( souther Kerala ) , Munnar Hills , Nilgiri Hills and Trivandrum .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"goa gap\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"western ghats\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It flows in a southwesterly direction for about from near Mill Creek Summit in the San Gabriel Mountains to join Big Tujunga Creek near the village of Hidden Springs .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mill creek summit\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"san gabriel mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The town derived its name from the Sierra de Aracena , which is part of the Sierra Morena system .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sierra de aracena\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sierra morena\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Storer ( ) is a jagged peak in the Tula Mountains , 4 nautical miles ( 7   km ) east - northeast of Mount Harvey .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount harvey\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tula mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Cold River begins at the height of land in Evans Notch , a pass through the eastern White Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"evans notch\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"white mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Birnlücke ( ) is the border pass at the western end of the Hohe Tauern mountains in Austria , between the Venediger Group and the adjoining Zillertal Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"birnlücke\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"venediger group\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Kuivinen Ridge ( ) is a transverse ridge extending southwest - northeast across the Saint Johns Range between an unnamed glacier and the Ringer Glacier in Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ringer glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"saint johns range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Alpine chipmunks only live in high Sierra Nevada , from Yosemite National Park in the north , to Olancha Peak in the south .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"olancha peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sierra nevada\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Skyway Monte Bianco is a cable car in the Alps , linking the Italian town of Courmayeur with Pointe Helbronner on the southern side of the Mont Blanc massif .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pointe helbronner\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mont blanc massif\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Massive in the Sawatch Range is the second - highest peak of the Rocky Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount massive\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sawatch range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"After ascending Sugar Loaf a horseshoe shaped route follows the finest ridges of the Black Mountains via Capel - y - ffin to Crickhowell .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sugar loaf\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"black mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Morské oko is a lake located in the Vihorlat Mountains in the east of Slovakia .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"morské oko\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"vihorlat mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Egbert ( ) is a mainly ice - covered mountain , high , south - southeast of Mount Stephenson in the Douglas Range of Alexander Island , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount egbert\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"douglas range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Dragons Lair Névé ( ) is a névé of about in the Hays Mountains , bounded by Mount Griffith , Mount Pulitzer , Taylor Ridge , and Vaughan Glacier .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"vaughan glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"hays mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Geologically , the Dunkelsteinerwald hills are foothills of the Waldviertel , an upland in the northwest of Lower Austria north of the Danube river and thus belonging to the Bohemian Massif .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"dunkelsteinerwald\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"bohemian massif\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Kwun Yótasi Range is a small subrange of the Swannell Ranges of the Omineca Mountains , located north of Tchentlo Lake and Nation Lakes in northern British Columbia , Canada .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kwun yótasi range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"swannell ranges\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Dalrymple ( ) is a mountain ( 3,600 m ) between Mount Alf and Mount Goldthwait in the northern part of the Sentinel Range , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount alf\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sentinel range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Gjertsen ( ) is a mountain , high , standing northeast of Mount Grier in the La Gorce Mountains , Queen Maud Mountains , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount grier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"la gorce mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is located high in the southern Green Mountains , with its little habitable terrain sandwiched between the main spine of those mountains and Mount Snow .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount snow\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"green mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Appalachians extend northwards into New Hampshire as the White Mountains , and then into Maine and Canada .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"white mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"appalachians\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Muck Glacier ( ) is a glacier between Campbell Cliffs and Sullivan Ridge in the Queen Maud Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"muck glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"queen maud mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It is the tenth highest peak in Peru and the third in the Huayhuash range ( after Yerupajá and Siula Grande ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"siula grande\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"huayhuash\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The county 's highest point is the 10,631   ft ( 3240 m ) summit of Diamond Peak in the Diamond Mountains along the border with White Pine County .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"diamond peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"diamond mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Towle Glacier ( ) is a glacier in the Convoy Range of Victoria Land , draining northeast between Eastwind and Elkhorn Ridges into the Fry Glacier .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"towle glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"convoy range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"on the western slope of Barania Góra in the Silesian Beskids .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"barania góra\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"silesian beskids\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"High Raise is a fell in the Central Fells of the English Lake District , not to be confused with another High Raise situated in the Far Eastern Fells .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"high raise\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lake district\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The most diverse and touristically interesting part of the Ammergau Alps is in the Hochplatten - Tegelberg Group .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"tegelberg\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"ammergau alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Galatea is the highest peak of the Kananaskis Range , a subrange of the Canadian Rockies in the province of Alberta .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kananaskis range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"canadian rockies\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Kelly Glacier ( ) is a steep tributary glacier descending southwest from Mount Peacock to enter Tucker Glacier just south of Mount Titus , in the Admiralty Mountains of Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"tucker glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"admiralty mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The town is also known as Jarque de Moncayo , despite its location at the feet of the Sierra de la Virgen , another range of the Iberian System .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"sierra de la virgen\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"iberian system\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\" Not to be confused with Mount Nicholas \\\\\\\" \\\\n Mount Nichols ( ) is a mountain , 670 m , in the central part of the Harold Byrd Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount nichols\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"harold byrd mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The FIS Alpine World Ski Championships 1939 were held 12–15 February at Kasprowy Wierch in the Western Tatras , south of Zakopane , Poland .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kasprowy wierch\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"western tatras\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The area forms part of the Central Eastern Alps and compromises large parts of the Ötztal Alps and in the west contains parts of the Samnaun Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"ötztal alps\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"central eastern alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Mount Titus ( ) is a mountain , 2,840   m , surmounting the heights between the Staircase and Kelly Glaciers in the Admiralty Mountains , Victoria Land .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"staircase\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"admiralty mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The hut lies at an elevation of above sea level , at the Tracuit Pass , between Les Diablons and the Tête de Milon in the Pennine Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"tête de milon\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pennine alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Bastion Peak - Northeast Peak is located in the Wind River Range in the U.S. state of Wyoming .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"bastion peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"wind river range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Dante 's View is part of the Black Mountains , a part of Amargosa Range , that was geological Mesozoic volcanoes .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"black mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"amargosa range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Kintla Peak is the tallest mountain in the Livingston Range and the third tallest in Glacier National Park .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"kintla peak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"livingston range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Tengger massif ( including Mount Bromo ) , and Mount Semeru , Java 's highest peak , lie in this section .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount bromo\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"tengger massif\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The mountains that surround the Nachvak are the highest in Labrador , where both Mount Razorback to the north and Mount Caubvick to the south are located .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount caubvick\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Mátra ( Slovak : \\\\\\\" Matra \\\\\\\" ) is part of the North Hungarian Mountains and belongs by origin to the largest young volcanic zone of Europe .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"matra\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"north hungarian mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Argus Range is one of the westernmost of the Basin and Range Province ranges .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"argus range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"basin and range province\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The highest peak on Majorca is Puig Major at in the Serra de Tramuntana .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"puig major\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"serra de tramuntana\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Aurdalsegga Ridge ( ) is an irregular ridge long surmounted by Mount Nikolayev , rising immediately southeast of Aurdalen Valley in the Südliche Petermann Range of the Wohlthat Mountains in Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount nikolayev\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"südliche petermann range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"A long , narrow ice - free valley in the Convoy Range , running north from its head immediately east of Mount Gunn into the Greenville Valley .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount gunn\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"convoy range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Mount Kapaz or Kepez ( ) is a mountain in Lesser Caucasus near Ganja city in central Azerbaijan .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount kapaz\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lesser caucasus\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"On the other hand , the Kellerwald 's highest point is on the Wüstegarten ( 675   m above sea level ) .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"wüstegarten\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"kellerwald\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The peak is located in the Entiat Mountains , a subrange of the North Cascades .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"entiat mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"north cascades\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The highest mountains in the valley are the Weissmies ( 4,017 m ) , the Lagginhorn ( 4,010 m ) and the Fletschhorn ( 3,993 m ) , all in the Pennine Alps .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"weissmies\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pennine alps\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Sprinkling Tarn is a body of water at the foot of Great End , in the Southern Fells in Lake District , 3   km from Seathwaite , Cumbria , England .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"great end\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"lake district\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Located about north - east of Mieroszów , south of Wałbrzych , and south - west of the regional capital Wrocław , Sokołowsko is the largest village within the Stone Mountains of the Central Sudetes .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"stone mountains\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"central sudetes\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Other rumours include those of suicide after years of unsuccessful campaigning or getting lost in the dense mossy forests around Bukit Batu Lawi in the Kelabit Highlands , close to the border with Kalimantan .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"bukit batu lawi\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"kelabit highlands\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Kosky Peak ( ) is a peak south of Mount Nordhill in the Welch Mountains of Palmer Land , Antarctica .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount nordhill\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"welch mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Ward Glacier ( ) is a small glacier between Terminus Mountain and Howchin Glacier on the east side of the Royal Society Range in Victoria Land .\\\", 