g massif\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Support Force Glacier is a major glacier in the Pensacola Mountains , draining northward between the Forrestal Range and Argentina Range to the Filchner - Ronne Ice Shelf .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"support force glacier\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pensacola mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"It has an area of 2589   km2 and is a subrange of the Pelly Mountains which in turn form part of the Yukon Ranges . Glenlyon Range in the Canadian Mountain Encyclopedia\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"glenlyon range\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"pelly mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The DeRemer Nunataks are a group of nunataks centered about 4   nautical miles ( 7   km ) southeast of Mount Blowaway in the Wilson Hills .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount blowaway\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"wilson hills\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Crestones are a cluster of high summits in the Sangre de Cristo Range , comprising Crestone Peak , Crestone Needle , Kit Carson Peak , Challenger Point , Humboldt Peak , and Columbia Point .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"columbia point\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"sangre de cristo range\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"He did many paintings of Jerusalem ( including the Western Wall and the Mount of Olives ) , Tel Aviv , the Sea of Galilee and the Judaean Mountains .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount of olives\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"judaean mountains\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"mountain range\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P4552\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Claydon Peak ( ) is a peak in the Que