e 1870s , practised Judaism .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"julius vogel\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"jewish\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Wigby was allowed to baptize him and later converted Senachwine to Christianity .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"senachwine\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"christianity\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The Neturei Karta synagogues follow the customs of the Gaon of Vilna , due to Neturei Karta 's origin within the Lithuanian rather than Hasidic branch of ultra - Orthodox Judaism .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"gaon of vilna\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"orthodox judaism\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The suburb is also home to the Fink Karp Ivany campus of Mount Scopus Memorial College , a Jewish day school .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"mount scopus memorial college\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"jewish\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Boutros Ghali was born to a Coptic Christian family in Kiman - al-‘Arus , a village of Beni Suef , Egypt , in 1846 .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"boutros ghali\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"christian\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"On 10 April 2005 , Thaksin Shinawatra presided over a \\\\\\\" secret \\\\\\\" and \\\\\\\" private \\\\\\\" merit - making ceremony at the Temple of the Emerald Buddha , the holiest site in Thai Buddhism .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"thaksin shinawatra\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"buddhism\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Currently , it is the seat of the Aragatsotn Diocese of the Armenian Apostolic Church .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"aragatsotn diocese