mils\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"christianity\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Others , such as J. D. Salinger , Sean Penn , Don Rickles , Moe Howard , Curly Howard , Shemp Howard and Pink , had their Jewish ancestors come from Lithuanian lands .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"curly howard\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"jewish\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"In 1999 Father Philip Mizer with Alypy Medvedev , OSBM , was finally converted to the Catholic Church in Poland , by Jan Martyniak .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"jan martyniak\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"catholic church\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"In the 19th century , it became an important centre of Hasidism as the longtime home of Rabbi Menachem Mendel of Kotzk , the Kotzker rebbe who established the Kotsk dynasty .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"menachem mendel of kotzk\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"hasidism\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"The parish has a well - established marriage preparation program ( Pre - Cana instruction ) and serves as the main centre for Roman Catholic parishes in Bangkok to send couples for marriage preparation .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"pre-cana\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"roman catholic\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Both were devout Catholics and friends of Archbishop of Sydney ( later Cardinal ) Patrick Francis Moran , and their firm designed extensively for the Catholic Church in New South Wales .\\\", \\\"head_entity\\\": \\\"patrick francis moran\\\", \\\"tail_entity\\\": \\\"catholic church\\\", \\\"relation_type\\\": \\\"religion\\\", \\\"relation_pid\\\": \\\"P140\\\"}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Both schools flourished but